ithub.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T14:49:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T14:49:09Z","body":"> Did I miss something? Did I fail to implement a suggestion?\r\n\r\nThere are several, I've marked them as unresolved, please resolve them or answer the questions in them before marking them as resolved","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724215940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724677819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3724677819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3724677819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eAhK7","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T16:31:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T16:31:42Z","body":"I am seeing too many hallmarks of an AI agent-generated PR here. There are too many changes that make no sense and are not necessary for implementing the proposed feature, the description is obviously AI-generated, and the logs left by the AI-agent are left in the PR in the original commit. \r\n\r\nPlease note we do not allow PRs that are made entirely by AI. It is a requirement that _you understand the code that you submit_ (https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#contribute-only-what-you-understand). Dumping a bunch of code from your AI agent on us and getting us to review the slop it produces is not acceptable. If you choose to use an AI agent to develop, you _must_ take full responsibility and review every line of code that it produces and only submit code that is useful and beneficial for the project. \r\n\r\nI am going to close this PR as a result. It is not fair to ATS to ask her to spend time reviewing code that you haven't even taken the time to review yourself. If you want to go ahead with this feature, then please open a new PR that:\r\n1. You fully understand and have reviewed (or better yet actually written the code for)\r\n2. You have tested and actually works (see the failing checks)\r\n3. Does not include any unrelated changes suggested by the AI that are not needed for the feature","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724677819/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725574631","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3725574631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3725574631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eD8Hn","user":{"login":"brunosrz","id":244238563,"node_id":"U_kgDODo7I4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244238563?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz","html_url":"https://github.com/brunosrz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T20:10:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T20:10:56Z","body":"The documentation and pull request description were indeed created by AI, as were the SVGs, but all the code was written by me. I'm a beginner in C++, this is my first real project, and I've been working on it for 2 months. I started by implementing it as a plugin and then migrated it to the engine; the code wasn't written using AI.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725574631/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725577262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3725577262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3725577262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eD8wu","user":{"login":"brunosrz","id":244238563,"node_id":"U_kgDODo7I4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244238563?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz","html_url":"https://github.com/brunosrz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T20:11:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T20:11:35Z","body":"I don't speak English, so I use a translator. I've also never participated in/developed anything in a group, so I don't know how to submit a pull request; that's why I used AI.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725577262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726162417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3726162417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3726162417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eGLnx","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T22:40:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T22:40:56Z","body":"> The documentation and pull request description were indeed created by AI, as were the SVGs, but all the code was written by me. I'm a beginner in C++, this is my first real project, and I've been working on it for 2 months. I started by implementing it as a plugin and then migrated it to the engine; the code wasn't written using AI.\r\n\r\nI'm sorry, I don't believe you. It is extra suspicious that you are only disclosing your use of AI to generate an SVG after you have been caught. \r\n\r\nUltimately, it isn't a very good idea for a beginner programmer who doesn't even know how to open a pull request to try to write 3000 lines of C++ code that they don't understand and submit it to a codebase that is running on millions of devices. We have to maintain a very high standard of quality for our code. \r\n\r\nThat being said, you are still welcome to contribute including making another attempt that this feature. I will repeat what I said above:\r\n\r\n> If you want to go ahead with this feature, then please open a new PR that:\r\n> \r\n> 1. You fully understand and have reviewed (or better yet actually written the code for)\r\n> 2. You have tested and actually works (see the failing checks)\r\n> 3. Does not include any unrelated changes suggested by the AI that are not needed for the feature\r\n\r\nIf you are really interested in working on Godot and learning C++ at the same time, I recommend picking a much smaller task that will be more suitable for your skill level. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726162417/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726180607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3726180607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3726180607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eGQD_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T22:43:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T22:43:35Z","body":"Note that there's already an open pull request implementing a virtual joystick node:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110933","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726180607/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726233149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3726233149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3726233149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eGc49","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T22:53:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T22:53:00Z","body":"> as outlined in Godot Proposals https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13943 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11192.\r\n\r\nProposal [13943](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13943) \r\n\r\nThe proposal was submitted by you and was closed 4 days ago; the reasons are listed here.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13943#issuecomment-3708522888\r\n_The use of AI is already being criticized there as well._\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\n>  I'm a beginner in C++, this is my first real project, and I've been working on it for 2 months\r\n\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pr_workflow.html\r\n\r\nEspecially for beginners, it's important to understand what the AI ​​is doing. Let your AI explain it to you, and check every answer to make sure it's correct. Free AI models often have an error rate of at least 15%.\r\n\r\nNote: it's very unusual for a beginner to write, understand, test, and fix over 3000 lines of code within two months. Even experienced programmers with over 20 years of experience can't manage that in their free time without AI assistance. 😃 \r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726233149/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726622807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3726622807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3726622807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eH8BX","user":{"login":"brunosrz","id":244238563,"node_id":"U_kgDODo7I4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244238563?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz","html_url":"https://github.com/brunosrz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T01:07:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T01:07:00Z","body":"> Observe que já existe uma solicitação de pull request aberta implementando um nó de joystick virtual:\r\n> \r\n> * [Adicionar VirtualJoystick  #110933](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110933)\r\n\r\nAnd is my system just a virtual joystick node? No, it's not. I added button, dpad, joystick, joystickdynamic, and touchpad—not just nodes, but inputs as well. It's worth mentioning that there's another pull request on the same topic, if it is the same topic, but that's not the case. And about you saying I didn't test it, I did test it extensively. And I didn't mention before that I used architectural intelligence because I didn't think it was relevant/I didn't think it would harm me over something trivial.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726622807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3726629109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114718#issuecomment-3726629109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114718","id":3726629109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eH9j1","user":{"login":"brunosrz","id":244